            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hardinlove"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was looking for a white barbeque sauce after I watched food network and the travel channel and saw southern barbeque joints using it. I made as listed exactly. I didn't get an overpowering vinegar taste and everyone loved it. I used it basting chicken leg quarters in the oven and the grill. We also used a little as a dipping sauce. Creamy, garlicky with a little tang. Loved it!"
          },
