              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "toni dennie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "used on chicken wings and cole slaw...Very good. I did Half mayo and Half yogurt to make it more creamy. Doubled garlic and Horseradish. Will probably use more horseradish next time.",
