            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Teri Scott"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for smoked chicken- it was really good! My husband said it was ok for something different. I would add this in as an alternative to the regular tomato based bbq sauce or vinegar based sauce. They are all good- just all very different from one another, although this is pretty close to the Vinegar based 'Cornell' like marinades. For great results- pull off grill a few minutes before done and tent in foil for 10 minutes- super juicy!",
            "datePublished": "2015-09-28T12:39:44.530Z"
